{
  "name": "vsmcp",
  "displayName": "VSMCP",
  "description": "让网页版 ChatGPT 通过 MCP + 内网穿透读、改你电脑上 VS Code 打开的项目：一键开外网、多窗口自动跟随 / 锁定、断线自动恢复。",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "publisher": "yari",
  "private": true,
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.93.0"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/Yari-tuber/vsmcp"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Yari-tuber/vsmcp/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Yari-tuber/vsmcp#readme",
  "license": "MIT",
  "categories": [
    "AI",
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "mcp",
    "chatgpt",
    "ai",
    "agent",
    "tunnel",
    "cloudflared",
    "lsp"
  ],
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "viewsContainers": {
      "activitybar": [
        {
          "id": "vsmcp",
          "title": "VSMCP",
          "icon": "media/icon.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "vsmcp": [
        {
          "type": "webview",
          "id": "vsmcp.panel",
          "name": "控制台"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "VSMCP",
      "properties": {
        "vsmcp.port": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 3333,
          "markdownDescription": "每个 VS Code 窗口自己的 MCP 服务从这个端口开始找空闲口（默认 3333–3337，五个窗口）。一般不用改。"
        },
        "vsmcp.portFallback": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "端口被占用时顺延到后面的端口（`vsmcp.port` 起共 5 个）。多开窗口需要它，默认开。关掉后只用 `vsmcp.port`，第二个窗口会起不来。"
        },
        "vsmcp.hubPort": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 3340,
          "markdownDescription": "Hub 端口：所有窗口里只有一个当 Hub，外网隧道接在这个端口上，再转给「AI 现在操作的项目」所在窗口。不要和 `vsmcp.port` 起的 5 个端口重叠。"
        },
        "vsmcp.autoStartTunnel": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "markdownDescription": "VS Code 启动时自动开启外网（由 Hub 窗口负责）。平时也可以在侧栏面板或状态栏「外网」上一键开关。\n\n[一键开启/关闭外网](command:vsmcp.toggleTunnel)"
        },
        "vsmcp.autoRecover": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "外网断了自动重建：刚启动的 90 秒不算、断开满 60 秒才重建，重建间隔 120 秒起、每次翻倍、最长 600 秒。"
        },
        "vsmcp.enableContextPush": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "description": "自动把上下文更新（活动文件、选区、诊断信息）推送给已连接的智能体（SSE 连接）"
        },
        "vsmcp.authToken": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "可选的 Bearer 令牌。**留空 = 不鉴权**（网页版 ChatGPT 填不了请求头，默认就是留空）。填了以后所有请求都要带 `Authorization: Bearer <令牌>`。"
        },
        "vsmcp.allowedCommands": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "default": [],
          "markdownDescription": "`execute_vscode_command` 工具允许执行的 VS Code 命令。**留空 = 不限制**；填了就只允许列表里的命令。"
        },
        "vsmcp.tunnelProvider": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "cloudflare",
            "localtunnel"
          ],
          "enumDescriptions": [
            "cloudflared（默认）：临时地址每次随机；配隧道令牌 / 命名隧道可得到固定地址。国内连通性最好，需要装 cloudflared（没装会提示一键安装）。",
            "localtunnel（loca.lt）：零账号、零域名、不用装 cloudflared，地址可固定；免费第三方服务，稳定性和延迟不如 Cloudflare。"
          ],
          "default": "cloudflare",
          "markdownDescription": "外网隧道用哪一种。\n\n- `cloudflare`：cloudflared（临时隧道地址每次随机；令牌 / 命名隧道地址固定）\n- `localtunnel`：loca.lt，零账号、零域名，地址形如 `https://<子域名>.loca.lt/mcp`"
        },
        "vsmcp.tunnelSubdomain": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "`localtunnel` 的固定子域名（如 `my-mcp-7f3a`），地址为 `https://<子域名>.loca.lt/mcp`。\n\n留空 = 自动生成一个**随机**子域名并保存（重启不变，别人猜不到）。loca.lt 的子域名先到先得、没法真正预留，建议留空。"
        },
        "vsmcp.tunnelTokenFile": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "**令牌隧道（固定公网地址）**：令牌是敏感凭据，**不要写进 settings.json**。任选一种：\n\n1. 命令面板运行「VSMCP：设置隧道令牌」，存进系统凭据库（推荐）；\n2. 写进一个**仓库之外**的文件，在这里填文件路径（支持 `~`）。\n\n需要和 `vsmcp.tunnelHostname` 一起用，地址固定为 `https://<tunnelHostname>/mcp`。"
        },
        "vsmcp.tunnelName": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "description": "自建命名隧道的名称（需要先在 ~/.cloudflared 完成 cloudflared tunnel login / create / route dns）。留空 = 用 trycloudflare 临时隧道（地址每次开都会变）。"
        },
        "vsmcp.tunnelHostname": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "description": "令牌隧道 / 命名隧道对应的固定域名（如 mcp.example.com），外网地址固定为 https://<域名>/mcp。"
        },
        "vsmcp.terminalStrategy": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "childProcess",
            "shellIntegration"
          ],
          "default": "childProcess",
          "description": "run_terminal_command 的执行方式：childProcess 能可靠拿到输出；shellIntegration 会在 VS Code 终端面板里显示（需要 VS Code 1.93+）"
        },
        "vsmcp.commandTimeoutMs": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 120000,
          "minimum": 1000,
          "description": "run_terminal_command 没传 timeoutMs 时的默认超时（毫秒，默认 2 分钟；单次最长 1 小时）"
        }
      }
    },
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.openPanel",
        "title": "打开控制台",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.toggleTunnel",
        "title": "开启 / 关闭外网",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.startTunnel",
        "title": "开启外网",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.stopTunnel",
        "title": "关闭外网",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.copyPublicUrl",
        "title": "复制 ChatGPT 连接地址",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.showTunnelUrl",
        "title": "显示 / 复制外网地址",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.copyUsagePrompt",
        "title": "复制使用提示词",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.copyVerifyPrompt",
        "title": "复制 GPT 验证提示词",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.copyKeyPrompt",
        "title": "复制关键提示词（地址 + 使用指令）",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.copyLocalUrl",
        "title": "复制本机地址",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.lockCurrent",
        "title": "锁定当前项目给 AI",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.autoFollow",
        "title": "自动跟随最后点过的窗口",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.selectTarget",
        "title": "选择给 AI 的项目",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.recover",
        "title": "启动 / 恢复连接",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.diagnose",
        "title": "连接自检",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.showLogs",
        "title": "查看日志",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.refresh",
        "title": "刷新",
        "category": "VSMCP",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.openSettings",
        "title": "打开设置",
        "category": "VSMCP",
        "icon": "$(gear)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.setTunnelToken",
        "title": "设置隧道令牌",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.clearTunnelToken",
        "title": "清除隧道令牌",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.start",
        "title": "启动本窗口 MCP 服务",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.stop",
        "title": "停止本窗口 MCP 服务",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.restart",
        "title": "重启本窗口 MCP 服务",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      },
      {
        "command": "vsmcp.showStatus",
        "title": "查看状态 / 选项",
        "category": "VSMCP"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "vsmcp.refresh",
          "when": "view == vsmcp.panel",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "vsmcp.openSettings",
          "when": "view == vsmcp.panel",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        }
      ],
      "commandPalette": [
        {
          "command": "vsmcp.refresh",
          "when": "false"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run build:prod",
    "build": "node esbuild.config.mjs",
    "build:prod": "node esbuild.config.mjs --production",
    "watch": "node esbuild.config.mjs --watch",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "node scripts/build-tests.mjs && node --test --test-reporter=spec \"out-test/*.test.cjs\"",
    "package": "vsce package --no-dependencies",
    "e2e": "node scripts/e2e/run.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk": "^1.32.2",
    "localtunnel": "^2.0.2",
    "zod": "^4.6.7"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^22.20.5",
    "@types/vscode": "1.93.0",
    "@vscode/test-electron": "^3.1.0",
    "@vscode/vsce": "^4.1.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3"
  }
}
